- Serum thyroid-stimulating hormone (TSH) and free T4 (hypothyroidism can cause psychosis);  
- Vitamin B12 and folate (deficiency causes neuropsychiatric symptoms);  
- Rapid plasma reagin (RPR) or treponemal test (neurosyphilis);  
